{"version":"6.9","hitCount":1,"request":{"queryString":"BOOK_ID:NBK526056 OR BOOK_ID:NBK999999999","resultType":"core","cursorMark":"*","pageSize":2,"sort":"","synonym":false},"resultList":{"result":[{"id":"30252312","source":"MED","pmid":"30252312","title":"Anatomy, Shoulder and Upper Limb, Nerves","authorString":"Okwumabua E, Black AC, Thompson JH.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Okwumabua E","lastName":"Okwumabua","firstName":"Ebubechi","initials":"E","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Meharry Medical College"}]}},{"fullName":"Black AC","lastName":"Black","firstName":"Asa C.","initials":"AC","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"University of South Carolina Greenville School of Medicine"}]}},{"fullName":"Thompson JH","lastName":"Thompson","firstName":"Johnathan H.","initials":"JH","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"The Hughston Clinic"}]}}]},"pubYear":"2023","abstractText":"The upper limb includes the scapula, clavicle, humerus, radius, ulna, carpals, metacarpals, and small bones of the hand. Innervation originates in the neck and travels down to allow muscle action of flexion, extension, pronation, supination, and rotation necessary to achieve activities of daily living. The brachial plexus is a critically important structure in managing the transition from isolated nerve roots to the complex nerves that innervate the muscles of the upper limb.","affiliation":"Meharry Medical College","publicationStatus":"ppublish","language":"eng","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["Study Guide"]},"bookOrReportDetails":{"publisher":"StatPearls Publishing, Treasure Island (FL)","comprisingTitle":"StatPearls","yearOfPublication":2023},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Free","availabilityCode":"F","documentStyle":"html","site":"Europe_PMC","url":"http://europepmc.org/books/NBK526056"},{"availability":"Free","availabilityCode":"F","documentStyle":"html","site":"NCBI_Bookshelf","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK526056"}]},"isOpenAccess":"Y","inEPMC":"Y","inPMC":"Y","citedByCount":0,"hasReferences":"N","hasTextMinedTerms":"Y","hasDbCrossReferences":"N","hasPDF":"N","hasBook":"Y","bookid":"NBK526056","hasSuppl":"N","hasLabsLinks":"N","hasData":"N","authMan":"N","epmcAuthMan":"N","nihAuthMan":"N","hasTMAccessionNumbers":"N","dateOfCreation":"2023-07-30","firstPublicationDate":"2023-07-30","firstIndexDate":"2018-09-29","hasEvaluations":"N"}]}}